  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Formulation of two Project Documents</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the consultancy is to provide quality control of the draft &#x201c;Municipality Twinning Cooperation Programmne &#x2013; Ukraine and Denmark&#x201d; programme document and - if necessary -  advise and assist the Danish &#x2018;National Association of Municipalities&#x2019; with the finalization/adjustments of the document. The consultancy will also assist during the inception phase with the finalization of formats (applications, reporting, documentation), planning and management structure.</narrative>
  </description>
